<p>Once the app is working locally, you’ll push the repo to GitHub and then deploy to AWS App Runner using the built-in CI/CD workflow.</p>
<h4>Installing FastAPI and uvicorn</h4>
<p>To isolate project dependencies, poetry will create a Python virtual environment associated with the project. To serve the application, we’ll use <a href="https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/deployment/manually/#run-a-server-manually-uvicorn">uvicorn</a>.</p>
<p>Now, using poetry (or your preferred dependency manager), install <code>fastapi</code> and <code>uvicorn</code>.</p>
