d by Neon Postgres as the serverless database.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"FastAPI is a modern, fast (high-performance), web framework for building APIs with Python 3.8+ based on standard Python type hints. The key features of FastAPI are its speed and ease of use, making it an excellent choice for building robust APIs. FastAPI has quickly become a go-to framework for setting up Python APIs and services.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"AWS App Runner is a fully managed service that makes it easy for developers to quickly deploy containerized web applications and APIs, at scale. These services will automatically scale the instances up or down for your App Runner application in accordance to incoming traffic volume.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Neon complements this setup by providing a serverless Postgres database that \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/docs/introduction/autoscaling\",\"children\":\"scales compute resources automatically\"}],\", optimizing performance based on demand.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We’ll walk through deploying a FastAPI application with Neon Serverless Postgres, focusing on secure database connection management via AWS Systems Manager (SSM) Parameter Store. This approach allows for flexible application environment management across development, testing, and production stages.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Let’s get started!\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"prerequisites\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Prerequisites\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#prerequisites\",